<section class="content-section"><div class="wrap page-split"><div><p class="section-kicker">ABOUT THE PRODUCT</p><h2 style="font-family:'DM Sans',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700">SHYFT Box Finder for home and office storage.</h2><p>SHYFT is designed around home and office storage tracking. It helps users label, search and retrieve boxes and items while maintaining a record of what is stored and where. Consistent labels and a simple storage convention help make the system useful over time.</p><p>Before adopting any operational software, confirm feature availability, data handling, device compatibility and rollout requirements for your organisation.</p></div><div><ol class="page-list"><li><span>01</span><div><strong>Focused workflow</strong><p>Use a consistent way to identify boxes and the items stored inside them.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><strong>Operational context</strong><p>Organise storage locations so people can record where an item belongs.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><strong>Requirements clarity</strong><p>Make the information attached to each box useful for future searches.</p></div></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Deployment fit</strong><p>Review the storage workflow and confirm app availability and device requirements.</p></div></li></ol></div></div></section>
